// smartcharging/notify_ev_charging_needs.go:66's own StateOfCharge field
// (*int, validate:"omitempty,gte=0,lte=100") is the real anatomy this
// fixture pins: minimum 0 makes this an optional-numeric pointer (the
// narrowed optionality rule — no minimum, or minimum <= 0, both admit a
// pointer), and maximum renders lte=, ordered after gte= exactly like
// every other bound token in this directory (BaseTagSet's own doc
// comment).

StateOfCharge *int `json:"stateOfCharge,omitempty" validate:"omitempty,gte=0,lte=100"`
